  "prefLabel": "Plc 2004.02 Certificant Responsibilities for Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2004.02 Certificant Responsibilities for Renewal. Each certificant shall:\n\n(a) Know when the individual’s certification is due to expire; and\n\n(b) File an application for renewal prior to the expiration of the current certification in accordance with Plc 2005 if the certificant wishes to continue to practice as a certified CHW in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
